{
    "title": "Paper Doll: Fashion Dress Up",
    "description": "Have you ever played paper doll dress up game?\r\nNow you can play it on your phone by downloading Sweet Paper Doll: Dress Up DIY now. In the game you will be able to own your own doll, change clothes every day to suit the new place you will go. Choose your doll's beautiful clothes and make up. This doll makeover challenge allows you to craft your own.\r\nYou will have a great experience with Sweet Paper Doll: Dress Up DIY. Unlock all items and upgrade your creative skills.\r\n+ Full costumes, fashion accessories\r\n+ Unlock all the collections to make your doll high fashion\r\n+ Adjust the doll's skin color, eye color, hairstyle, and makeup tone\r\nTry it now!",
